---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="About — FastLicense"
  description="FastLicense is the timeline satellite in Cornerstone’s three-site directory. It publishes cited clocks, not invented week ranges."
>
  <section class="masthead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">About</p>
      <h1>A calendar, not a brochure.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        FastLicense is the speed and timeline desk for Cornerstone’s four cores. It exists so
        operators can see what is published — and what is not — before they plan a launch date.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>Who this is for</h2>
      <p>
        Lenders, mortgage companies, money services businesses, and accounts receivable management
        firms that need a honest read on review time. The directory is national. It is not written
        around one city or one state’s office culture.
      </p>

      <h2>Who files the work</h2>
      <p>
        Applications discussed here are prepared and filed by
        <a href={SITE.cornerstone.url}>{SITE.cornerstone.name}</a>, the U.S. licensing operating
        partner for those four cores. FastLicense does not take filings, collect fees, or issue
        licenses.
      </p>

      <h2>The three-site split</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>This site</strong> answers how long, what delays, and when an expedite exists.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href={SITE.sisters.simple.url}>{SITE.sisters.simple.name}</a> answers {SITE.sisters.simple.job}.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href={SITE.sisters.store.url}>{SITE.sisters.store.name}</a> answers {SITE.sisters.store.job}.
      </p>

      <h2>Ownership</h2>
      <p>
        FastLicense is a Hanok satellite. Editorial rules live on the
        <a href="/methodology/">methods</a> page. If a figure is not on a public statute or
        regulator page, we leave the typical range blank.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
